# Keep the build context minimal. The image build's context is the repo ROOT so the
# in-container `dotnet publish` sees the root-level Directory.Build.props (GenerateDocumentationFile
# -> MsSqlOperator.xml, read at runtime for CRD descriptions) and .editorconfig (CA2100=suggestion,
# required under TreatWarningsAsErrors). Everything not needed by the publish is excluded below.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
.git/
.github/
charts/
docs/
local/
tests/
*.md
LICENSE
*.sln
renovate.json
global.json
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.gitignore
src/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
